    "rule": "Routine NPC living costs are macro-economic expenses, not per-person monthly writes. Exact characters spend currency only when their personal finances materially matter."
  },
  "macro_rules": {
    "recurrence_kind": "calendar_month_start",
    "clock": "07:00:00",
    "arrears_catchup_cap_milli": 1000,
    "rule": "Macro settlement uses net background-budget transfers against aggregate economy holders plus only strategically meaningful exact transfers. Ordinary shop revenue, civilian wages, routine payroll, taxes, meals, rent, and household commerce are not separate ledgers. A short source pays only what it has, records arrears, and never blocks world time. At most one current-period amount of old arrears is added to a later payment attempt."
  },
